---
title:    "A Modular and Generic Analysis Server System for Functional Logic Programs"
citation: "(PEPM 2014)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/PEPM14.html"
date:     2014-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper presents the ideas and implementation of the [program analysis framework CASS](/tools/cass "Curry Analysis Server System")
which is part of the [PAKCS](http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~pakcs/ "Portland Aachen Kiel Curry System")
and [KiCS2](http://www-ps.informatik.uni-kiel.de/kics2 "Kiel Curry System") distributions.